<title>UK: TABLE - Greenalls H1 profit rises 12 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Greenalls H1 profit rises 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half</p>
<p>		 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.94		  vs 15.97</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.70		   vs 6.22</p>
<p> Pretax		     63.9		   vs 57.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   554.8		  vs 527.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Current H1 results exclude an exceptional charge of about 6.18 million stg, including pub reorganisation costs.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 61.1 and 66.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Greenalls Group Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
